This package includes a modified, pinned LSP runtime distributed by
code-yeongyu/lazycodex under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Yeongyu Kim.
The upstream license is included in vendor/LICENSE. Exact provenance and
SHA-256 are recorded in vendor/provenance.json.

Upstream vendored bytes remain unchanged. scripts/build.ts generates the
adapted runtime: seven analysis/status tools, independent configuration and
daemon identity, read-only refusal guidance, and optional Godot TCP bridging.
No source or prompt text from the SUL-only OMO checkout is incorporated.

The original LSP package traces its runtime to codex-lsp and pi-lsp-client.
Those projects are MIT-licensed; pi-lsp-client's NOTICE documents the
original author's MIT relicensing. This package preserves the license of
the actual pinned distribution it consumes, rather than assuming all OMO
monorepo sources are MIT.
